# hidsight-cli --watch on the Logi Bolt Receiver of the maintainer's desk: the
# session reads the MX Keys S (index 1) and the MX Master 3S (index 2); then
# the charging cable of the keyboard is unplugged and plugged in twice (the
# contact bounces), and the mouse is switched off and on. Replies to the app,
# which ran at the same time, were filtered out; unit ids are zeroed.
